Package: rapsimng.sorghum
Title: Crop-Specific Functions and Parameters for APSIM Next Generation Sorghum Model
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Bangyou", "Zheng", , "zheng.bangyou@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides sorghum-specific functions, processes and parameter sets used by
    sorghum model in the Agricultural Production Systems sIMulator ('APSIM') Next Generation.
    Includes tools for crop process calculations, parameter management and customisation, 
    enabling users to explore, modify and apply sorghum model components.
